#: src/luna/mod.rs:394
msgid "Runs a local server other apps on this computer can use"
msgstr ""
"Ejecuta un servidor local que otras apps de esta computadora pueden usar"

#: src/luna/mod.rs:396
msgid "Stores files in its own data folder only"
msgstr "Guarda archivos solo en su propia carpeta de datos"

#: src/luna/mod.rs:398
msgid "Runs background (native) code in the sandbox"
msgstr "Ejecuta código en segundo plano (nativo) en el entorno aislado"

#: src/luna/mod.rs:400
msgid "Changes the app's look or adds controls"
msgstr "Cambia el aspecto de la app o añade controles"

#: src/luna/mod.rs:402
msgid "Runs programs on your computer (asks you first)"
msgstr "Ejecuta programas en tu computadora (te pregunta antes)"

#: src/luna/mod.rs:406
msgid "Changes your TIDAL playlists and favourites itself (asks you first)"
msgstr ""
"Modifica por sí mismo tus playlists y favoritos de TIDAL (te pregunta antes)"

#: src/luna/mod.rs:408
msgid "Uses your TIDAL sign-in (asks you first)"
msgstr "Usa tu inicio de sesión de TIDAL (te pregunta antes)"

#: src/luna/mod.rs:411
msgid "Uses keyboard shortcuts across your whole computer (asks you first)"
msgstr "Usa atajos de teclado en toda la computadora (te pregunta antes)"

#: src/luna/mod.rs:415
msgid "Talks to another program over its own pipe or socket (asks you first)"
msgstr ""
"Se comunica con otro programa mediante su propia tubería o socket (te "
"pregunta antes)"

#: src/luna/mod.rs:417
msgid "Saves TIDAL songs as files (asks you first)"
msgstr "Guarda canciones de TIDAL como archivos (te pregunta antes)"

#: src/luna/mod.rs:420
msgid "Switches the output to exclusive (bit-perfect) mode (asks you first)"
msgstr "Cambia la salida al modo exclusivo (bit-perfect) (te pregunta antes)"

#: src/luna/mod.rs:457
msgid "Not supported"
msgstr "No compatible"

#: src/luna/mod.rs:458
msgid "Partly supported"
msgstr "Compatibilidad parcial"

#: src/luna/mod.rs:459
msgid "Needs your permission"
msgstr "Necesita tu permiso"

#: src/luna/mod.rs:483
msgid ""
"This build needs TIDAL's own Last.fm key, which Tidalfast does not have."
msgstr ""
"Esta versión necesita la clave de Last.fm propia de TIDAL, que Tidalfast no "
"tiene."

#: src/luna/mod.rs:487
msgid ""
"It saves TIDAL songs as files, which it does only after you allow it (this "
"may break TIDAL's terms of use)."
msgstr ""
"Guarda canciones de TIDAL como archivos, y solo lo hace después de que lo "
"permitas (esto puede infringir las condiciones de uso de TIDAL)."

#: src/luna/mod.rs:491
msgid ""
"It needs TIDAL's own remote control code, which Tidalfast does not have."
msgstr ""
"Necesita el código de control remoto propio de TIDAL, que Tidalfast no tiene."

#: src/luna/mod.rs:495
msgid ""
"It works out its bars with ffmpeg in a separate Node process, which "
"Tidalfast does not have."
msgstr ""
"Calcula sus barras con ffmpeg en un proceso de Node aparte, que Tidalfast no "
"tiene."

#: src/luna/mod.rs:499
msgid ""
"It sends your TIDAL sign-in to its author's server, which it does only after "
"you allow it."
msgstr ""
"Envía tu inicio de sesión de TIDAL al servidor de su autor, y solo lo hace "
"después de que lo permitas."

#: src/luna/mod.rs:503
msgid ""
"Its mini player is a separate browser window, which Tidalfast does not "
"include."
msgstr ""
"Su minirreproductor es una ventana de navegador independiente, que Tidalfast "
"no incluye."

#: src/luna/mod.rs:507
msgid ""
"It takes the media keys across the whole computer, which it does only after "
"you allow it (Windows only)."
msgstr ""
"Toma el control de las teclas multimedia en toda la computadora, y solo lo "
"hace después de que lo permitas (solo Windows)."

#: src/luna/mod.rs:511
msgid ""
"It plays through mpv, which needs your permission to start mpv, talk to it "
"over its pipe and get TIDAL's audio."
msgstr ""
"Reproduce a través de mpv, para lo que necesita tu permiso para iniciar mpv, "
"comunicarse con él por su tubería y obtener el audio de TIDAL."

#: src/luna/mod.rs:515
msgid ""
"It marks playlists inside TIDAL's web \"add to playlist\" window, which "
"Tidalfast does not have."
msgstr ""
"Marca las playlists dentro de la ventana web «Añadir a una playlist» de "
"TIDAL, que Tidalfast no tiene."

#: src/luna/mod.rs:519
msgid ""
"It needs a native add-on that Tidalfast cannot load (Tidalfast has its own "
"media controls)."
msgstr ""
"Necesita un complemento nativo que Tidalfast no puede cargar (Tidalfast "
"tiene sus propios controles multimedia)."

#: src/luna/mod.rs:523
msgid ""
"Last.fm scrobbling needs TIDAL's own Last.fm key, which Tidalfast does not "
"have."
msgstr ""
"El scrobbling de Last.fm necesita la clave de Last.fm propia de TIDAL, que "
"Tidalfast no tiene."

#: src/luna/mod.rs:527
msgid ""
"The lyrics bubble over the player bar works, but its separate lyrics window "
"does not, because that needs a browser engine."
msgstr ""
"La burbuja de letras sobre la barra del reproductor funciona, pero su "
"ventana de letras independiente no, porque necesita un motor de navegador."

#: src/luna/mod.rs:531
msgid ""
"The Small depth model works, but the Base model (about 100 MB) is more than "
"a plugin may download here."
msgstr ""
"El modelo de profundidad Small funciona, pero el modelo Base (unos 100 MB) "
"supera lo que un plugin puede descargar aquí."

